  "description": "Multi-project extension of UiPath's official 'Copy package between environments' Automation Ops Pipeline template (v2.0.1): Download package from a source Orchestrator folder, Publish it to a destination Orchestrator folder, looped over every project listed in projects-manifest.csv so one pipeline run promotes all of them together (e.g. shared/DEV -> mk/UAT, or mk/UAT -> mk-laptop/PROD). Per-project failures are isolated so one broken project does not stop the batch; the run still fails overall if any project failed.",
